# Hospital Patient Management System

## Description

A Python-based Hospital Patient Management System for managing
patient information.

## Features

- Add Patient
- View Patients
- Search Patient
- Update Patient
- Delete Patient
- JSON File Storage
- Exception Handling

## Concepts Used

- Python OOP
- Classes and Objects
- Functions
- Lists
- Dictionaries
- Loops
- Conditional Statements
- JSON File Handling
- Exception Handling

## How to Run

```bash
python main.py